=== task: predict easy
title: Going round
code:
```python
graph = {"a": ["b"], "b": ["c"], "c": ["b", "d"], "d": []}

needs = {v: [] for v in graph}
for u in graph:
    for v in graph[u]:
        needs[v].append(u)

done = []
while len(done) < len(graph):
    free = None
    for v in graph:
        if v not in done and all(u in done for u in needs[v]):
            free = v
            break
    if free is None:
